      "type": "Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)",
      "notes": "Nature's Life(R) Omega 3 EFA Complex is a natural source of Fatty Acids in the Omega 3 family."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "From deep, cold water fish, their natural body oils are extracted in a unique process that ensures the delicate nutritive value of the essential fatty acids is retained. The oils are the hermetically sealed in softgel capsules, with a naturally opaque carob coating to protect the oils from the damaging effects of ultraviolet light.\n"
